		(uuid "61988ec3-5a14-4b5b-a547-597bfc22a703")
	)
	(text "The values of the:\n- Compensation capacitor (4.7nF)\n- Inductor (4.7uH for -5V)\n- Output capacitor (>12uF)\n- Voltage divider\n- Feed-forward network\n\nWere recommended by the datasheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.634 147.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "73e755ad-6c1f-40d6-aba9-1e10dc08ab2f")
	)
	(text "To produce a swing of 3.3v the maximum\ncurrent sourced from the opamp would be\n8 mA (Rl = 3.3 / 0.008 = 400 Ohm approx.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 161.036 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "763dc139-6c24-4d34-80d1-90b1aeddd7c9")
	)
	(text "Ven = 12*[2/(2+3)] = 4.8v\nRising enable threshold = 1.22v\nMaximum is 6v (thus not tied to 12v)\nCould be left floating but is tied to\nprevent being affected by noise."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.798 77.978 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a423825a-b72e-4362-9f04-af32bbcbf68d")
	)
	(text "The LC-filter at Vin is recommended\nby the datasheet."
